# Adoption Modes And KPIs

Repos move through staged adoption:

- Observe: report gaps only.
- Assist: provide commands and setup guidance without blocking.
- Evidence: require evidence in closeout, no CI blocking.
- Enforced: block missing required evidence after owner sign-off.

No repo starts in enforced mode. Enforcement requires baseline metrics, false
positive review, and owner sign-off.

Core KPI reporting fields:

- active plugin version;
- adoption mode;
- evidence presence;
- bead or spec coverage;
- memory recall feedback and valid memory writes;
- eager token estimate;
- false positive rate.
